        f"Cumulative measured execution wall across the checkpointed final-method jobs is **{process_seconds:.1f}s ({process_seconds/60:.2f}min)**, including {prepare_seconds:.1f}s of repeated source preparation and the retained10-second allocation timeout. This is not one uninterrupted annual stopwatch. It excludes earlier compiler/certificate development experiments and the independent audit, which takes {audit['seconds']:.1f}s. The CSV/figure cover all365 completed days. Failed-attempt receipts remain in the local provenance checkpoints.",'',
        '![Daily runtime and measured runtime phases](assets/europe-linked-clearing-2025-runtime.png)','',
        '## What was run','',
