        'Preserved development failures: the initial preflight used exact emergency-zero equality and was corrected to the existing tolerance; a strict auxiliary price search stopped on4January despite already valid conditional prices (minimum family surplus about−5.9e-7EUR). The final certificate-first implementation accepts only directly checked prices at the unchanged0.05EUR economic tolerance. On7January a10-second allocation limit was reached before optimality proof; the final execution budget permits60seconds per solve/300seconds per day without relaxing optimality or physics gates. The six already checked days are reused with parent-record/source/witness hashes, not inferred from stale progress. Earlier failures remain local and are not counted as completed annual days.','',
